            "title": "Skills between shifts. Managers",
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "text": "Sketch a pathway once and the workspace keeps it fresh as roles shift and teams scale across cities. Short lessons arrive in the flow of a working day, so practice feels light rather than like homework. Coaches pair newcomers with seasoned colleagues and the quiet feed shows who could help next. Every badge, nudge and reminder is written",
                "linkPhrases": []
              },
              {
                "text": "For humans first, with plain words and honest progress bars. Leaders see where confidence rises and where a team might need a fresh workshop before the busy season starts. Rollouts take weeks instead of quarters because templates, sample journeys and friendly onboarding come ready to adapt. Lumora plugs into the apps your people already open each morning, from rota planners to chat channels and shared drives",
                "linkPhrases": []
              }
            ],
            "image": {
              "assetRole": "placeholder.neutral",
              "placeholderLabel": "Admins keep"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Control of permissions, retention",
            "paragraphs": [
